            "block_content": "[V2G20-5031] After receiving the WPT_PairingRes with \"ResponseCode = OK\" and EVSEProcessing = \"Ongoing\", the EVCC shall send a WPT_PairingReq with EVProcessing set to \"Finished\" within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 190 if the pairing process is finished (see also [V2G20-5012]).",
